            "value": "USD"
          },
          {
            "op": "const",
            "value": "THB"
          }
        ],
        "params": {}
      },
      "evidence": [
        "no currency column exists; the only currency evidence is the '$' prefix in every price cell ('$1234.56', '$1279')",
        "'$' is ambiguous across ISO codes, so this provisional mapping is flagged by one clarification (action value_map, source_value '$'); no FX conversion is performed",
        "schema default THB used only when the cell carries no symbol"
      ],
      "note": "The contract requires an ISO-4217 currency code and defaults to THB, but the only currency evidence in the file is an ambiguous '$' symbol. Labelling it wrongly would misprice every product downstream, and the operator forbade inferring currency or converting FX.",
